Value Required ROUTER (\S+)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value IP_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value CREATION_ORIGIN (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*router\s+"${ROUTER}"\s*\{ -> Continue
  ^\s*interface\s+"${INTERFACE}"\s*\{ -> Continue
  ^\s*oper-address\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s*$$ -> Continue
  ^\s*creation-origin\s+${CREATION_ORIGIN}\s*$$ -> Record
